stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: parse request List[BlobIdentifier]
    q_parse --> q_compute_range: range = [min(current_epoch - MIN_EPOCHS_BLOB, FULU_FORK_EPOCH), FULU_FORK_EPOCH)
    q_compute_range --> q_iter: for root in requested roots
    q_iter --> q_check_epoch: lookup block epoch for root
    q_check_epoch --> q_respond: block in transition range / return blob sidecar
    q_check_epoch --> q_skip: block at or after FULU_FORK_EPOCH / MAY skip
    q_respond --> q_iter: sidecar sent
    q_skip --> q_iter: skipped
    q_iter --> [*]: all roots processed
